Error [jet.InvalidOutput]: Output entry is not a function reference
  --> tests/ui/output_entry_text.jet:1:45
    |
  1 | APP: Output.Executable{name: "demo", entry: "start"}
    |                                             ^^^^^^^
 Why: Text names, calls, and runtime reflection are not Output links
 Fix: Write a bare or qualified function reference, such as `entry: run`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1321
